# Build context for Dockerfile.runtime only. BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in preference to .dockerignore when it exists, which is the whole reason this file
# is here: the root .dockerignore excludes build/, and build/ is the only thing this
# image needs.
#
# Excluding everything and re-including two paths also keeps the context at ~47 MB
# instead of the whole repo, so the runtime image build is a few seconds.
*
!build
!nginx.conf
